# ResQAI Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env.local and add your Google AI Studio Gemini API Key if you wish to use live cloud AI.
# If left empty, ResQAI seamlessly activates its built-in clinical & HAZMAT heuristic engine for full 100% functionality.

VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
VITE_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
